  Object.assign(translations.ru, {"About the course →":"О курсе →","Certificate of Course Completion · Beginner · 6 hours":"Сертификат о завершении курса · Начальный уровень · 6 часов","This Cisco Networking Academy course introduced me to the foundations of data science, data analytics and data engineering, together with how artificial intelligence and machine learning use data to support decisions and predictions.":"Этот курс Cisco Networking Academy познакомил меня с основами Data Science, анализа данных и инженерии данных, а также с тем, как искусственный интеллект и машинное обучение используют данные для принятия решений и прогнозирования.","How does raw data become information that supports better decisions?":"Как исходные данные превращаются в информацию, которая помогает принимать более обоснованные решения?","What the course covers":"Что охватывает курс","The course provides a foundation in data science and explains the relationship between data analytics, data engineering, data science, artificial intelligence and machine learning.":"Курс формирует базовое понимание Data Science и объясняет взаимосвязь между анализом данных, инженерией данных, Data Science, искусственным интеллектом и машинным обучением.","Curriculum":"Содержание курса","Experience Analytics":"Практика аналитики","Data Collection and Storage":"Сбор и хранение данных","Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning":"Искусственный интеллект и машинное обучение","Embarking on Your Career in Data Analytics":"Начало карьеры в аналитике данных","Learning format":"Формат обучения","Beginner level with no recommended prerequisites.":"Начальный уровень, рекомендуемых предварительных требований нет.","Approximately 6 hours of learning.":"Примерно 6 часов обучения.","4 modules and 5 practice lab activities.":"4 модуля и 5 практических лабораторных заданий.","Videos, knowledge checks, module quizzes and a final exam.":"Видеоматериалы, проверки знаний, тесты по модулям и итоговый экзамен.","Knowledge and skills":"Знания и навыки","Understanding how data analytics supports data-driven decisions.":"Понимание того, как аналитика данных поддерживает принятие решений на основе данных.","Recognizing structured, semi-structured and unstructured data.":"Распознавание структурированных, полуструктурированных и неструктурированных данных.","Understanding data collection, storage and preparation for analysis.":"Понимание сбора, хранения и подготовки данных к анализу.","Exploring the 5 Vs of Big Data: Volume, Velocity, Variety, Veracity and Value.":"Изучение 5V больших данных: объём, скорость, разнообразие, достоверность и ценность.","Understanding how AI and machine learning use data.":"Понимание того, как ИИ и машинное обучение используют данные.","Distinguishing between data analyst, data engineer and data scientist roles.":"Понимание различий между ролями аналитика данных, инженера данных и специалиста по Data Science.","Course recognition":"Подтверждение прохождения","Cisco Networking Academy recognizes completion of the course. Cisco also offers a related digital badge; its published earning criteria list a 70% passing score on the comprehensive exam.":"Cisco Networking Academy подтверждает завершение курса. Cisco также предлагает связанный цифровой бейдж; опубликованные критерии его получения указывают проходной балл 70% за комплексный экзамен.","Why it is relevant to my profile":"Почему это важно для моего профиля","The course strengthens my foundation in data-driven decision-making and complements my work in business analytics, management and digital transformation.":"Курс укрепляет мою базу в принятии решений на основе данных и дополняет мою работу в бизнес-аналитике, менеджменте и цифровой трансформации.","Certificate & official course":"Сертификат и официальный курс","View my Cisco certificate ↗":"Посмотреть мой сертификат Cisco ↗","View the official Cisco course ↗":"Открыть официальный курс Cisco ↗","What this adds to my profile":"Что это добавляет к моему профилю","A structured foundation in data concepts, analytics, AI/ML and the data career landscape, supporting more informed use of data in business and management contexts.":"Структурированная база по данным, аналитике, ИИ/ML и карьерным направлениям в сфере данных, помогающая более осознанно использовать данные в бизнесе и менеджменте.","Cisco Networking Academy · Introduction to Data Science · Certificate completed in 2026.":"Cisco Networking Academy · Introduction to Data Science · Сертификат получен в 2026 году."});
  Object.assign(translations.uz, {"About the course →":"Kurs haqida →","Certificate of Course Completion · Beginner · 6 hours":"Kursni tamomlash sertifikati · Boshlang‘ich daraja · 6 soat","This Cisco Networking Academy course introduced me to the foundations of data science, data analytics and data engineering, together with how artificial intelligence and machine learning use data to support decisions and predictions.":"Ushbu Cisco Networking Academy kursi menga Data Science, ma’lumotlar tahlili va data engineering asoslarini, shuningdek sun’iy intellekt va mashinaviy o‘rganish qarorlar va prognozlarni qo‘llab-quvvatlash uchun ma’lumotlardan qanday foydalanishini o‘rgatdi.","How does raw data become information that supports better decisions?":"Xom ma’lumotlar qanday qilib yaxshiroq qaror qabul qilishga yordam beradigan axborotga aylanadi?","What the course covers":"Kurs nimalarni qamrab oladi","The course provides a foundation in data science and explains the relationship between data analytics, data engineering, data science, artificial intelligence and machine learning.":"Kurs Data Science bo‘yicha asosiy tushunchalarni beradi va ma’lumotlar tahlili, data engineering, Data Science, sun’iy intellekt hamda mashinaviy o‘rganish o‘rtasidagi bog‘liqlikni tushuntiradi.","Curriculum":"Kurs mazmuni","Experience Analytics":"Analitika bilan amaliy tanishuv","Data Collection and Storage":"Ma’lumotlarni yig‘ish va saqlash","Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning":"Sun’iy intellekt va mashinaviy o‘rganish","Embarking on Your Career in Data Analytics":"Ma’lumotlar tahlili sohasidagi karyerani boshlash","Learning format":"O‘qish formati","Beginner level with no recommended prerequisites.":"Boshlang‘ich daraja, tavsiya etilgan oldindan talablar yo‘q.","Approximately 6 hours of learning.":"Taxminan 6 soatlik ta’lim.","4 modules and 5 practice lab activities.":"4 modul va 5 ta amaliy laboratoriya mashg‘uloti.","Videos, knowledge checks, module quizzes and a final exam.":"Videolar, bilimni tekshirish topshiriqlari, modul testlari va yakuniy imtihon.","Knowledge and skills":"Bilim va ko‘nikmalar","Understanding how data analytics supports data-driven decisions.":"Ma’lumotlar tahlili ma’lumotlarga asoslangan qarorlarni qanday qo‘llab-quvvatlashini tushunish.","Recognizing structured, semi-structured and unstructured data.":"Tuzilgan, yarim tuzilgan va tuzilmagan ma’lumotlarni farqlash.","Understanding data collection, storage and preparation for analysis.":"Ma’lumotlarni yig‘ish, saqlash va tahlilga tayyorlashni tushunish.","Exploring the 5 Vs of Big Data: Volume, Velocity, Variety, Veracity and Value.":"Big Data’ning 5V tushunchalari: hajm, tezlik, xilma-xillik, ishonchlilik va qiymatni o‘rganish.","Understanding how AI and machine learning use data.":"AI va mashinaviy o‘rganish ma’lumotlardan qanday foydalanishini tushunish.","Distinguishing between data analyst, data engineer and data scientist roles.":"Data analyst, data engineer va data scientist rollari o‘rtasidagi farqlarni tushunish.","Course recognition":"Kurs natijasining tasdig‘i","Cisco Networking Academy recognizes completion of the course. Cisco also offers a related digital badge; its published earning criteria list a 70% passing score on the comprehensive exam.":"Cisco Networking Academy kurs yakunlanganini tasdiqlaydi. Cisco ushbu kursga tegishli raqamli badge ham taklif qiladi; e’lon qilingan mezonlarda kompleks imtihondan o‘tish uchun 70% natija ko‘rsatilgan.","Why it is relevant to my profile":"Bu mening profilim uchun nega muhim","The course strengthens my foundation in data-driven decision-making and complements my work in business analytics, management and digital transformation.":"Kurs ma’lumotlarga asoslangan qaror qabul qilish bo‘yicha tayyorgarligimni kuchaytiradi va biznes tahlili, menejment hamda raqamli transformatsiyadagi faoliyatimni to‘ldiradi.","Certificate & official course":"Sertifikat va rasmiy kurs","View my Cisco certificate ↗":"Cisco sertifikatimni ko‘rish ↗","View the official Cisco course ↗":"Cisco rasmiy kursini ko‘rish ↗","What this adds to my profile":"Bu mening profilimga nima qo‘shadi","A structured foundation in data concepts, analytics, AI/ML and the data career landscape, supporting more informed use of data in business and management contexts.":"Ma’lumotlar tushunchalari, tahlil, AI/ML va ma’lumotlar sohasidagi karyera yo‘nalishlari bo‘yicha tizimli asos bo‘lib, biznes va menejmentda ma’lumotlardan yanada ongli foydalanishga yordam beradi.","Cisco Networking Academy · Introduction to Data Science · Certificate completed in 2026.":"Cisco Networking Academy · Introduction to Data Science · Sertifikat 2026 yilda yakunlangan."});
